// Lesson template v4 (docs/COURSE_DESIGN_COMMUNICATIVE.md §12). One storyline, a year after the B1 course: Jaan Mets is
// the kitchen head of Kase kool; the school lunch survey showed that children leave vegetables on the plate and buy
// sweets after school, so Jaan reforms the school menu. One goal said on the first sheet: at the end the learner, as
// Jaan, presents the new menu to the school board and the parents (talk + questions and answers) and writes a
// semi-formal letter to all families (044 Kasuta). The module adds the food and nutrition topic (docs/
// METHODOLOGY_STANDARD.md §6.2): the school kitchen, Kadri (paediatrician) on children's food, allergies (Oskar nuts,
// Markus milk, Kristiina's daughter gluten), a sugar tax, the school lunch survey.
// Grammar (B2, docs/METHODOLOGY_STANDARD.md §5): change of state — muutuma / minema / jääma / hakkama / saama + the
// translative, and muutma / tegema + -ks (B1 module 7 met jäin haigeks / sain terveks; here plural, comparative and
// figurative uses): taught in 041 (notice, table, match in Avasta; wordforms, a cloze and a meaning choice in Harjuta;
// used in the Kasuta post), back in 044 (notice, a forms text and the word-order task, the rubric of the letter) and
// in passing in 042 (Kadri's radio advice) and 043 (error fix, the café listening). Also: soft advice with the
// conditional (042), the past conditional — oleks pidanud / oleks võinud (043), plan connectors kuna, selleks et,
// esimesel kuul, seetõttu (044). Module 8's words return (kultuur, traditsioon, identiteet, kuuluma, laulupidu, kodu,
// kodumaa, reis, kogemus, harjuma, erinevus, eelarve, säästma, kompromiss, soovitama, osutuma).
//   041 Jaan's story in the school paper (how he became a school cook); the Friday tasting day in the canteen
//       (listening: Daria's borscht); a magazine text on how a habit forms (4-option cloze); the health month at
//       Tuul Logistika — colleagues' habit cards, Jaan and Markus choose a habit, Jaan's talk, an intranet post.
//   042 Kadri on the radio about children's food (listening); a nutrition advice column (Markus's milk allergy,
//       Helgi's sweets for the grandchildren), Kadri's blog on a child with an allergy at school (sentence bank);
//       Viktor at the Nõmme culture house — the notice board, Anna's advice, a voice message to Jaan, a letter.
//   043 Markus's notes on a week of stress; a Harno B2 article on a sugar tax (MC), a radio debate (excerpts played
//       once), a 1-min work-topic monologue, a debate with pro / contra cards; Anna and Markus in a café (listening),
//       three feasible changes, Markus talks to Liis, Anna's e-mail with the plan.
//   044 Markus's three-month plan (picture) and Jaan's draft menu plan (sentence bank) with the survey chart; the
//       nutritionist's lecture to the kitchen staff (Harno lecture gap fill), Jaan's note to the cooks (forms); the
